(3625950, 507723, 47852, '<td valign="top">The Cat in the Hat, seems he''s missing a nose,<br/>And where Thing 2 has gone, nobody knows!</td>', 'The Cat in the Hat, seems he''s missing a nose,And where Thing 2 has gone, nobody knows!', '2007-05-07 20:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625957, 508052, 47852, '<td valign="top">The Grinch, it seems, has turned into a clown,<br/>And though his mouth has a smile, it still looks like a frown.<br/>Just wait one more minute, the Grinch does declare,<br/>I''ll get more boas and scarves, and maybe blue hair!<br/> <br/>A strange combination of clothes for the Grinch, but your model was very patient to endure that green makeup.  Hope it came off quickly!</td>', 'The Grinch, it seems, has turned into a clown,And though his mouth has a smile, it still looks like a frown.Just wait one more minute, the Grinch does declare,I''ll get more boas and scarves, and maybe blue hair! A strange combination of clothes for the Grinch, but your model was very patient to endure that green makeup.  Hope it came off quickly!', '2007-05-07 20:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625966, 506222, 47852, '<td valign="top">One puff, two puff,<br/>Yellow puff, orange puff.<br/>This one is a little soft,<br/>This one is a bit aloft!</td>', 'One puff, two puff,Yellow puff, orange puff.This one is a little soft,This one is a bit aloft!', '2007-05-07 20:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625973, 506222, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, mushroom clouds... an unbelievable spin on the challenge. Great vision. I''ve not seen the movie, but can imagine this not being a story for the kiddies. Hope for your sake that people have taken the time to look this one up on the net before judging.</td>', 'Wow, mushroom clouds... an unbelievable spin on the challenge. Great vision. I''ve not seen the movie, but can imagine this not being a story for the kiddies. Hope for your sake that people have taken the time to look this one up on the net before judging.', '2007-05-07 20:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625986, 507980, 47852, '<td valign="top">And deep in the Grickle-grass, some people say,<br/>You can still see the Lorax standing today.<br/>Taking pictures of fungusy truffula trunks,<br/>That were chopped by the Once-lers Thneed making punks!<br/> <br/>Interesting lighting.  I always pictured truffula trees as thinner with far fewer rings in them!  But I can picture a full forest of these poor trees.</td>', 'And deep in the Grickle-grass, some people say,You can still see the Lorax standing today.Taking pictures of fungusy truffula trunks,That were chopped by the Once-lers Thneed making punks! Interesting lighting.  I always pictured truffula trees as thinner with far fewer rings in them!  But I can picture a full forest of these poor trees.', '2007-05-07 20:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625990, 507317, 47852, '<td valign="top">The cat in the hat, looks very displeased,<br/>Even moreso than if he''d had fleas!<br/>"Get this thing off!", the poor kitty declared,<br/>While the two little children just sat there and stared.</td>', 'The cat in the hat, looks very displeased,Even moreso than if he''d had fleas!"Get this thing off!", the poor kitty declared,While the two little children just sat there and stared.', '2007-05-07 20:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625994, 507765, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hehehe... not sure, did he actually write that? May have been better if the lighting wasn''t so dull and if we could see a little bit more of the leg(?) with a slightly straight-on point of view rather than downwards.</td>', 'Hehehe... not sure, did he actually write that? May have been better if the lighting wasn''t so dull and if we could see a little bit more of the leg(?) with a slightly straight-on point of view rather than downwards.', '2007-05-07 20:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626003, 508117, 47852, '<td valign="top">The white gloves are a symbol, of the Cat in the Hat,<br/>But those green eggs and ham, now I''d NEVER eat that!<br/>Theodore Geisel, he''s a man with a knack,<br/>For making up words like Ferspid and Burnack!<br/> <br/>(Those eggs really do look disgusting... I hope nobody had the job of eating them after the shoot!)</td>', 'The white gloves are a symbol, of the Cat in the Hat,But those green eggs and ham, now I''d NEVER eat that!Theodore Geisel, he''s a man with a knack,For making up words like Ferspid and Burnack! (Those eggs really do look disgusting... I hope nobody had the job of eating them after the shoot!)', '2007-05-07 20:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626022, 508050, 47852, '<td valign="top">The small Cindy Lou is now all grown up,<br/>She''s forgiven the Grinch, and Max, his pup.<br/>Her eyes are quite bright, her cheeks rosy and pink,<br/>Did she eat too many peppers and now needs a drink?<br/> <br/>Love the bright eyes here, but not sure I get the hands.  Not sure about the bright red border either.  It''s a great grown up version of Cindy Lou though! :)</td>', 'The small Cindy Lou is now all grown up,She''s forgiven the Grinch, and Max, his pup.Her eyes are quite bright, her cheeks rosy and pink,Did she eat too many peppers and now needs a drink? Love the bright eyes here, but not sure I get the hands.  Not sure about the bright red border either.  It''s a great grown up version of Cindy Lou though! :)', '2007-05-07 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626025, 507718, 47852, '<td valign="top">Green eggs have been made, with separate yolks,<br/>And the ham, it looks like green jello, fine folks!<br/>Place it all on a woven plate held up high,<br/>I still won''t eat them, I won''t even try!<br/> <br/>The composition here is great.. very Suess-like!</td>', 'Green eggs have been made, with separate yolks,And the ham, it looks like green jello, fine folks!Place it all on a woven plate held up high,I still won''t eat them, I won''t even try! The composition here is great.. very Suess-like!', '2007-05-07 20:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626045, 507312, 45475, '<td valign="top">Maybe not a ribbon, but a nice score if only you''d steadied yourself while taking the shot. Everything seems motion blurred slightly. Then a title change to: "One Fish, Two Fish, Red Fish" and bingo, success. Ok, I could be over-simplifying matters....</td>', 'Maybe not a ribbon, but a nice score if only you''d steadied yourself while taking the shot. Everything seems motion blurred slightly. Then a title change to: "One Fish, Two Fish, Red Fish" and bingo, success. Ok, I could be over-simplifying matters....', '2007-05-07 21:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
