(3626052, 508091, 47852, '<td valign="top">On the thirteenth of May, this Seuss shall end,<br/>And Horton''s place in the standings will be known, my friend.<br/>The elephants walk, and together stand tall,<br/>Reminding us "a person''s a person no matter how small".</td>', 'On the thirteenth of May, this Seuss shall end,And Horton''s place in the standings will be known, my friend.The elephants walk, and together stand tall,Reminding us "a person''s a person no matter how small".', '2007-05-07 21:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
