(3630250, 508098, 47316, '<td valign="top">Don''t know where you got the costume but awesome! This would be so much better though with some scenery instead of a plain background. I know a Christmas tree isn''t readily available this time of your but perhaps a fireplace. I dunno, I just feel you had a really great advantage with the costume but didn''t take it where you could have.</td>', 'Don''t know where you got the costume but awesome! This would be so much better though with some scenery instead of a plain background. I know a Christmas tree isn''t readily available this time of your but perhaps a fireplace. I dunno, I just feel you had a really great advantage with the costume but didn''t take it where you could have.', '2007-05-08 21:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
