(3630274, 507956, 47316, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot! Lacks punch to me because the lighting is pretty flat and the image needs more contrast. Although not always possible with little ones, it might bave been cute to maybe have her head resting on her hands on the "ornament". It would serve to bring her forward more instead of having the prop be so much more in front of her that she''s sort of hiding behind it. I would also have left the floor out.<br/> <br/>I dunno. I''m really big on using props minimally and focusing on the expression (especially with children), so just some ideas.</td>', 'Adorable shot! Lacks punch to me because the lighting is pretty flat and the image needs more contrast. Although not always possible with little ones, it might bave been cute to maybe have her head resting on her hands on the "ornament". It would serve to bring her forward more instead of having the prop be so much more in front of her that she''s sort of hiding behind it. I would also have left the floor out. I dunno. I''m really big on using props minimally and focusing on the expression (especially with children), so just some ideas.', '2007-05-08 21:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
