(3630526, 508059, 47852, '<td valign="top">A fox and a cat, Mr. Brown and some feet,<br/>Green eggs and ham down on Mulberry street.<br/>But where are Horton, the Lorax and Whos,<br/>The Sneetches, the Grinch and Bartholomew?<br/> <br/>The shot is a bit uninspired for me.  In a challenge full of creative and fun entries, this one is lacking.  Even using a more dramatic pose or lighting might have helped.</td>', 'A fox and a cat, Mr. Brown and some feet,Green eggs and ham down on Mulberry street.But where are Horton, the Lorax and Whos,The Sneetches, the Grinch and Bartholomew? The shot is a bit uninspired for me.  In a challenge full of creative and fun entries, this one is lacking.  Even using a more dramatic pose or lighting might have helped.', '2007-05-08 22:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
