(3630548, 507071, 47852, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, not more of these green eggs and ham.<br/>If I ate these I''d need a medical exam!<br/>The colors you made, they could not have been easy,<br/>But looking at this, makes my stomach quite queasy!<br/> <br/>Love the fork, it''s a nice touch to give it more of that Seuss-y feel, but really, that is some of the most unappetizing food!  I don''t know what Geisel was thinking when he wrote that!  The lighting here is a bit harsh for me with that big shadow but at least you weren''t using the onboard flash to make those greens even more unappealing! :)</td>', 'Oh dear, not more of these green eggs and ham.If I ate these I''d need a medical exam!The colors you made, they could not have been easy,But looking at this, makes my stomach quite queasy! Love the fork, it''s a nice touch to give it more of that Seuss-y feel, but really, that is some of the most unappetizing food!  I don''t know what Geisel was thinking when he wrote that!  The lighting here is a bit harsh for me with that big shadow but at least you weren''t using the onboard flash to make those greens even more unappealing! :)', '2007-05-08 22:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
