(3631888, 508026, 3087, '<td valign="top">I thought I was familiar with Dr Seuss but I don''t get the reference here. Nonetheless, I''m sure there''s a valid one so I don''t doubt you at all. I really love this image though - it has it''s own odd absurdity to it and is really rather intriguing and striking. I love the surreal bringing together of girl, musical nomenclature and bucket and mop.</td>', 'I thought I was familiar with Dr Seuss but I don''t get the reference here. Nonetheless, I''m sure there''s a valid one so I don''t doubt you at all. I really love this image though - it has it''s own odd absurdity to it and is really rather intriguing and striking. I love the surreal bringing together of girl, musical nomenclature and bucket and mop.', '2007-05-09 07:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3631889, 506742, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! What amazing lighting you''ve captured here. Your composition is lovely with the angle of those rays, the low horizon and the clouds and structure itself. The colours are great too.</td>', 'Wow! What amazing lighting you''ve captured here. Your composition is lovely with the angle of those rays, the low horizon and the clouds and structure itself. The colours are great too.', '2007-05-09 07:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
