(3632322, 508050, 39430, '<td valign="top">A few hopefully constructive comments...I don''t like the border on this.  This image shows typical late afternoon white balance variation between the light side of her face and the shadows.  I''d also like to see better focus on her eyes.  USM would even help a lot here.  Finally, she looks a bit bored.</td>', 'A few hopefully constructive comments...I don''t like the border on this.  This image shows typical late afternoon white balance variation between the light side of her face and the shadows.  I''d also like to see better focus on her eyes.  USM would even help a lot here.  Finally, she looks a bit bored.', '2007-05-09 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632331, 506049, 39430, '<td valign="top">The top of the image doesn''t add anything to the composition.  It might be better as a closer crop, possibly even pano.</td>', 'The top of the image doesn''t add anything to the composition.  It might be better as a closer crop, possibly even pano.', '2007-05-09 09:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632397, 508117, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced composition.  The neg space around the image almost makes a frame for the image, which is good.  There''s something wierd happening at the bottom of the picture frame, but i can''t work it out.  The only other thing that bother''s me is the fork, but no knife!  Overall, a great image.</td>', 'Nicely balanced composition.  The neg space around the image almost makes a frame for the image, which is good.  There''s something wierd happening at the bottom of the picture frame, but i can''t work it out.  The only other thing that bother''s me is the fork, but no knife!  Overall, a great image.', '2007-05-09 10:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
