(3632479, 507911, 41570, '<td valign="top">I havnt signed on in a long long time - just peek in.  But I had to retrieve my password just so I could sign in and tell you what a great job you did on this.<br/>Keep it up.</td>', 'I havnt signed on in a long long time - just peek in.  But I had to retrieve my password just so I could sign in and tell you what a great job you did on this.Keep it up.', '2007-05-09 10:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632484, 508074, 39430, '<td valign="top">The meal is a bit too elaborate to really fit the Dr Seuss image.  It''s a bit like green eggs and ham served at the breakfast menu of an alfresco cafe, with some interesting cutlery and other table ornaments, including a goldfish which Dr Seuss brought along from another story.  Maybe would have been better to keep it simple, so the subject of the photo doesn''t get lost in the clutter.  There''s also something wierd going on with the focus in the centre of the image.  I assume it''s been taken at a small aperture, and then manually blurred later in editing to get the shallow DOF effect, but I can''t work out why that one tomato is blurred when everything around it is in focus.  Nice colours and detail though.</td>', 'The meal is a bit too elaborate to really fit the Dr Seuss image.  It''s a bit like green eggs and ham served at the breakfast menu of an alfresco cafe, with some interesting cutlery and other table ornaments, including a goldfish which Dr Seuss brought along from another story.  Maybe would have been better to keep it simple, so the subject of the photo doesn''t get lost in the clutter.  There''s also something wierd going on with the focus in the centre of the image.  I assume it''s been taken at a small aperture, and then manually blurred later in editing to get the shallow DOF effect, but I can''t work out why that one tomato is blurred when everything around it is in focus.  Nice colours and detail though.', '2007-05-09 10:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632491, 507765, 39430, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s not real!</td>', 'I hope that''s not real!', '2007-05-09 10:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632497, 507149, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice monkey!  The vignetting looks unintentional.  It might be better to smooth it over a bit, and make it look like editing (regardless of whether it was in the original shot or not).  Nice use of 3rds</td>', 'Nice monkey!  The vignetting looks unintentional.  It might be better to smooth it over a bit, and make it look like editing (regardless of whether it was in the original shot or not).  Nice use of 3rds', '2007-05-09 10:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
