(3636842, 507407, 70181, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing your head hasn''t exploded from all that creativity in there.  Best photo of the challenge.</td>', 'It''s amazing your head hasn''t exploded from all that creativity in there.  Best photo of the challenge.', '2007-05-10 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
