(3636853, 507640, 60862, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, "Go, Dog, Go!" was written by P.D. Eastman, not Dr. Seuss.  That said, the dog could be sharper.  It looks like the focus is on his hind end, not his face.</td>', 'Unfortunately, "Go, Dog, Go!" was written by P.D. Eastman, not Dr. Seuss.  That said, the dog could be sharper.  It looks like the focus is on his hind end, not his face.', '2007-05-10 12:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
