(3639103, 507850, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the foreground duck''s face.  Seems like there should be more attention on the feet if that''s the point of the image ... maybe try desaturizing everything but them and/or use a much tighter crop?</td>', 'I like the expression on the foreground duck''s face.  Seems like there should be more attention on the feet if that''s the point of the image ... maybe try desaturizing everything but them and/or use a much tighter crop?', '2007-05-11 08:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639121, 507151, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think this could be improved by using softer lighting, removing the ham from the package, using a plate big enough to display the food without hanging over the edge, and perhaps playing with different arrangements of the eggs and ham and garnishes like you see in food magazines.  I realize the green eggs are not meant to look appetizing in the story, but their color alone is pretty off-putting.  Also, I''d suggest a much smaller border so you have more usable image space.</td>', 'I think this could be improved by using softer lighting, removing the ham from the package, using a plate big enough to display the food without hanging over the edge, and perhaps playing with different arrangements of the eggs and ham and garnishes like you see in food magazines.  I realize the green eggs are not meant to look appetizing in the story, but their color alone is pretty off-putting.  Also, I''d suggest a much smaller border so you have more usable image space.', '2007-05-11 08:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639124, 507153, 65234, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits the title and book; the uneveness of the background distracts me somewhat from the shadow.</td>', 'Definitely fits the title and book; the uneveness of the background distracts me somewhat from the shadow.', '2007-05-11 08:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639130, 507765, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather a perverse take on the challenge.  Lighting and angle make it difficult to read the tattoo, and the floor pattern competes with the tattoo and the hair on the arm for my attention.</td>', 'Rather a perverse take on the challenge.  Lighting and angle make it difficult to read the tattoo, and the floor pattern competes with the tattoo and the hair on the arm for my attention.', '2007-05-11 09:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639138, 507840, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can still recite most of that book by heart!  The two fish don''t look very comfy, or very alive, for that matter.  Don''t know how much control you had over their positioning but I would have preferred them to be more horizontal to unify the composition a bit more and focus on the sameness (fishes) and differences (number and pattern).</td>', 'I can still recite most of that book by heart!  The two fish don''t look very comfy, or very alive, for that matter.  Don''t know how much control you had over their positioning but I would have preferred them to be more horizontal to unify the composition a bit more and focus on the sameness (fishes) and differences (number and pattern).', '2007-05-11 09:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639147, 507956, 69246, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the border, but I love this composition!</td>', 'I''m not fond of the border, but I love this composition!', '2007-05-11 09:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639149, 508087, 25355, '<td valign="top">Yes, best one so far, I think.</td>', 'Yes, best one so far, I think.', '2007-05-11 09:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639160, 508120, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do not like them, Sam-I-am.  Interesting perspective but I would like to see more of the train and less of the completely clouded sky.  Or maybe Sam hanging out of the train window with a platter!</td>', 'I do not like them, Sam-I-am.  Interesting perspective but I would like to see more of the train and less of the completely clouded sky.  Or maybe Sam hanging out of the train window with a platter!', '2007-05-11 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639190, 507981, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''ve never read this book so I have no idea how an iguana fits into it, but this is a nicely detailed picture of an iguana.  I''d probably crop it tighter since most of the back end is out of the picture, anyway, and the wood chips aren''t of interest.</td>', 'I''ve never read this book so I have no idea how an iguana fits into it, but this is a nicely detailed picture of an iguana.  I''d probably crop it tighter since most of the back end is out of the picture, anyway, and the wood chips aren''t of interest.', '2007-05-11 09:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639194, 507980, 65234, '<td valign="top">I would feel sad for this tree, except that it appears to have been diseased (some sort of oozy fungal thing on the right).  A picture of an apparently healthy tree stump, maybe even this one from a different perspective, would better represent the theme of the book to me.</td>', 'I would feel sad for this tree, except that it appears to have been diseased (some sort of oozy fungal thing on the right).  A picture of an apparently healthy tree stump, maybe even this one from a different perspective, would better represent the theme of the book to me.', '2007-05-11 09:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639202, 508148, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the parallels in the book cover and scene; I would like this much better with even lighting.</td>', 'I like the parallels in the book cover and scene; I would like this much better with even lighting.', '2007-05-11 09:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639204, 508095, 65234, '<td valign="top">I hope the cat got LOTS of treats for posing in this getup!  Fun shot; I would like it a bit better with a solid background ike a piece of cloth covering the wall and carpet, and a softer light so the shadows aren''t so harsh.</td>', 'I hope the cat got LOTS of treats for posing in this getup!  Fun shot; I would like it a bit better with a solid background ike a piece of cloth covering the wall and carpet, and a softer light so the shadows aren''t so harsh.', '2007-05-11 09:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639209, 508091, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, Horton was cute as a baby!  I like the parallels in their trunks.  I''d clone out the pole behind them as it''s too close in color to the elephants and distracts a bit, and maybe crop even closer on the left and bottom since you don''t have all of mom in the shot, anyway, and the baby is meant to be the focus of attention.</td>', 'Aw, Horton was cute as a baby!  I like the parallels in their trunks.  I''d clone out the pole behind them as it''s too close in color to the elephants and distracts a bit, and maybe crop even closer on the left and bottom since you don''t have all of mom in the shot, anyway, and the baby is meant to be the focus of attention.', '2007-05-11 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639220, 507723, 65234, '<td valign="top">This would be more interesting if the Cat''s face was straightened out and the angle was such that I could see the characters'' eyes clearly.</td>', 'This would be more interesting if the Cat''s face was straightened out and the angle was such that I could see the characters'' eyes clearly.', '2007-05-11 10:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639271, 507681, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a lovely little Cindy!  Like the skewed perspective for this subject.</td>', 'What a lovely little Cindy!  Like the skewed perspective for this subject.', '2007-05-11 10:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639273, 508078, 65234, '<td valign="top">Poor cat!  Actually, kitten from the looks of it.  Very cute concept.  Nice choice of background; might have liked to see the whole hat even though it would emphasize the smallness of the cat, but this is still very cute.</td>', 'Poor cat!  Actually, kitten from the looks of it.  Very cute concept.  Nice choice of background; might have liked to see the whole hat even though it would emphasize the smallness of the cat, but this is still very cute.', '2007-05-11 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639276, 507369, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stop!  Looks like the kids REALLY enjoyed this shot ;-)  would prefer a plain background but this is a fun shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Stop!  Looks like the kids REALLY enjoyed this shot ;-)  would prefer a plain background but this is a fun shot nonetheless.', '2007-05-11 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639279, 507640, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot which suits the title.  Love the ears and expression!  Focus seems to be sharpest on the dog''s hips and I would prefer it on the eyes; also DOF looks odd to me, as the foreground grass is pretty sharp but the dog''s front legs, chest and shoulders are not, despite appearing to be the same horizontal distance from the camera and therefore in the same focal plane.  Hope that makes sense ;-)</td>', 'Nice action shot which suits the title.  Love the ears and expression!  Focus seems to be sharpest on the dog''s hips and I would prefer it on the eyes; also DOF looks odd to me, as the foreground grass is pretty sharp but the dog''s front legs, chest and shoulders are not, despite appearing to be the same horizontal distance from the camera and therefore in the same focal plane.  Hope that makes sense ;-)', '2007-05-11 10:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639280, 508121, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s what I used to call my two oldest children ;-)  Fun picture; lighting looks a little flat on my monitor.</td>', 'That''s what I used to call my two oldest children ;-)  Fun picture; lighting looks a little flat on my monitor.', '2007-05-11 10:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
