(3639289, 508133, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  Colors are nice, and the flowers in the Grinch''s hands are a nice touch.</td>', 'Very sweet.  Colors are nice, and the flowers in the Grinch''s hands are a nice touch.', '2007-05-11 10:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639291, 506551, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute face!  Meerkats are awfully cute.  Good detail and focus and pose.  I might play with desaturating or shifting the hue on the background a little to better complement the critter.</td>', 'Cute face!  Meerkats are awfully cute.  Good detail and focus and pose.  I might play with desaturating or shifting the hue on the background a little to better complement the critter.', '2007-05-11 10:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639336, 506742, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, gorgeous shot!  Absolutely love the capture of the light rays on the stones.  I might try saturating the color just a bit more but the composition is wonderful.</td>', 'Gorgeous, gorgeous shot!  Absolutely love the capture of the light rays on the stones.  I might try saturating the color just a bit more but the composition is wonderful.', '2007-05-11 10:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639337, 508093, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and leading lines in the wood.  Having the Once-ler peering out from the shadows suits the story nicely, and his vivid green draws the eye instantly.  I like this one a lot.</td>', 'Nice perspective and leading lines in the wood.  Having the Once-ler peering out from the shadows suits the story nicely, and his vivid green draws the eye instantly.  I like this one a lot.', '2007-05-11 10:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639338, 508146, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice setup!  Good color and great choice of background for the orange fish; I like the lighting for the most part (particularly on the lower left of the bowl) but find myself trying to figure out what the reflections are.  Very nice job overall.</td>', 'Nice setup!  Good color and great choice of background for the orange fish; I like the lighting for the most part (particularly on the lower left of the bowl) but find myself trying to figure out what the reflections are.  Very nice job overall.', '2007-05-11 10:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639345, 508098, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. At first I thought the red below the ornament was a reflection but now I see it''s probably the broken bit.  I think the composition would be stronger if that were cropped out, but that''s just because I''m easily confused.</td>', 'I like this a lot. At first I thought the red below the ornament was a reflection but now I see it''s probably the broken bit.  I think the composition would be stronger if that were cropped out, but that''s just because I''m easily confused.', '2007-05-11 10:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639354, 507920, 65234, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous - colors, composition, everything.  This beautifully captures the simple joy of summer at the beach :-)</td>', 'Simply gorgeous - colors, composition, everything.  This beautifully captures the simple joy of summer at the beach :-)', '2007-05-11 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639360, 508043, 65234, '<td valign="top">They do loook like Truffula Trees!  Nice find.</td>', 'They do loook like Truffula Trees!  Nice find.', '2007-05-11 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639368, 507911, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and stop-action.  The water below the fish''s tail makes me think there''s a hole in the bowl (pardon the rhyme) in addition to it being hoisted with the hook.</td>', 'Nice setup and stop-action.  The water below the fish''s tail makes me think there''s a hole in the bowl (pardon the rhyme) in addition to it being hoisted with the hook.', '2007-05-11 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639597, 507911, 72640, '<td valign="top">This is by far the best photo in this challenge!  Very creative</td>', 'This is by far the best photo in this challenge!  Very creative', '2007-05-11 12:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639601, 507920, 72640, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous', '2007-05-11 12:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640042, 508146, 69084, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic. I love the color scheme.</td>', 'Awesome pic. I love the color scheme.', '2007-05-11 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640114, 506222, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is supposed to be.  Doesn''t make much sense to me and image seems to have no discernible subject.</td>', 'Not sure what it is supposed to be.  Doesn''t make much sense to me and image seems to have no discernible subject.', '2007-05-11 16:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640119, 507842, 35602, '<td valign="top">really oof</td>', 'really oof', '2007-05-11 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640120, 507198, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems way oversharpened overall, though the oof foreground fish makes it seem oof.</td>', 'Seems way oversharpened overall, though the oof foreground fish makes it seem oof.', '2007-05-11 16:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640154, 506633, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is really good.  I love her expression.  I do think it''s a bit oversaturated though, at least on my monitor.  I also like the way the lace on her dress came out, apart from that one blown out part.  Overall I like it quite a lot.  It''s her expression that definitely makes it.</td>', 'This is really good.  I love her expression.  I do think it''s a bit oversaturated though, at least on my monitor.  I also like the way the lace on her dress came out, apart from that one blown out part.  Overall I like it quite a lot.  It''s her expression that definitely makes it.', '2007-05-11 17:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640157, 507681, 36382, '<td valign="top">Great job on the hair.  Very good.</td>', 'Great job on the hair.  Very good.', '2007-05-11 17:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3640165, 507151, 46314, '<td valign="top">A bit heavy-handed on the editing...</td>', 'A bit heavy-handed on the editing...', '2007-05-11 17:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
