(3646272, 507317, 30982, '<td valign="top">First, I love kteach''s poem for this one!  Excellent!  Second, I don''t know why you dodged the white into the background - the black from your original would have worked quite well, I think.  Just not sure what your goals were with the processing.  Of course, the hairy arm from the original had to go...  :-)  Really a very fun and creative shot - I especially like the cut-out kids and the hat falling onto the cat''s face.  Very well done!</td>', 'First, I love kteach''s poem for this one!  Excellent!  Second, I don''t know why you dodged the white into the background - the black from your original would have worked quite well, I think.  Just not sure what your goals were with the processing.  Of course, the hairy arm from the original had to go...  :-)  Really a very fun and creative shot - I especially like the cut-out kids and the hat falling onto the cat''s face.  Very well done!', '2007-05-14 05:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
