(3647557, 507407, 29269, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i>The setup work took about 5 hours, and my wife was an angel to stay up and push the shutter for me (she was literally half-asleep on the couch with the cable release). By the time I finished setting up, shooting, and cleaning up the mess, it was 4:30am. Ugh! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>She''s an angel to not have shoved that remote together with the tripod up somewhere... <br/> <br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert:The setup work took about 5 hours, and my wife was an angel to stay up and push the shutter for me (she was literally half-asleep on the couch with the cable release). By the time I finished setting up, shooting, and cleaning up the mess, it was 4:30am. Ugh!  She''s an angel to not have shoved that remote together with the tripod up somewhere...  Congratulations!', '2007-05-14 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
