(3648384, 507407, 22734, '<td valign="top">It is a cinch to say that you are busting at the seams with talent that just gushes out and that you continue to expand both in technique and creativity, but please allow me to go a step further. <br/> <br/>My dear friend you have become one of the tallest giants here at DPC. Your material has such universal appeal. You know how to please an audience and your showmanship is so adroit...ah, but then you are always so eager to share "the how to" and an untold number of members rejoyce in this highly valued information. I have seen your rise and I am so happy for you and your proud family.<br/> <br/>I can safely say that while you ride this tall wave of success, you have elevated DPC and have set benchmarks that define the quality and fun at DPC. Your images place that extra hurdle for the runner ups and this is good because it just makes this site better and stronger. We are all very proud of you!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-14 17:18:29.</i></td>', 'It is a cinch to say that you are busting at the seams with talent that just gushes out and that you continue to expand both in technique and creativity, but please allow me to go a step further.  My dear friend you have become one of the tallest giants here at DPC. Your material has such universal appeal. You know how to please an audience and your showmanship is so adroit...ah, but then you are always so eager to share "the how to" and an untold number of members rejoyce in this highly valued information. I have seen your rise and I am so happy for you and your proud family. I can safely say that while you ride this tall wave of success, you have elevated DPC and have set benchmarks that define the quality and fun at DPC. Your images place that extra hurdle for the runner ups and this is good because it just makes this site better and stronger. We are all very proud of you!', '2007-05-14 17:50:12.000000', '2007-05-14 18:18:29.000000', 0),
