(3654756, 507407, 489, '<td valign="top">I am continuously amazed at the level of creativity, effort, and true dedication that you put into these challenges, Shannon. The way you throw yourself completely into the photographic process, from conception to execution, is truly inspiring.</td>', 'I am continuously amazed at the level of creativity, effort, and true dedication that you put into these challenges, Shannon. The way you throw yourself completely into the photographic process, from conception to execution, is truly inspiring.', '2007-05-16 08:31:41.000000', NULL, 0),
