(3661707, 508098, 41214, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic photo!  Wonderful concept, brilliantly executed.  If I were you, I would definitely make Christmas cards from this image and sell them.  I know I would buy them!</td>', 'What a fantastic photo!  Wonderful concept, brilliantly executed.  If I were you, I would definitely make Christmas cards from this image and sell them.  I know I would buy them!', '2007-05-17 22:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3666177, 507407, 76430, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing, scalvert!  Since it''s Advanced Editing I was assuming it was a composite of multiple shots (though now I see that''s not legel) but it''s all one shot with almost Basic Editing!  You showed a lot of creativity and went to a lot of work to produce this, and hopefully the blue ribbon and adoration of your fan club is sufficient payback.</td>', 'Simply amazing, scalvert!  Since it''s Advanced Editing I was assuming it was a composite of multiple shots (though now I see that''s not legel) but it''s all one shot with almost Basic Editing!  You showed a lot of creativity and went to a lot of work to produce this, and hopefully the blue ribbon and adoration of your fan club is sufficient payback.', '2007-05-19 12:16:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3668374, 507407, 40679, '<td valign="top">why am I not surprised to see this one with the blue?<br/> <br/>Amazing, again. You have a talent. <br/> <br/>Congrats!!!</td>', 'why am I not surprised to see this one with the blue? Amazing, again. You have a talent.  Congrats!!!', '2007-05-20 07:32:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3675177, 508050, 67145, '<td valign="top">another awesome photograph ... you were up against some amazing images in this challenge .. i love the expression, the eyes, the hands, the hair, the scarf, and of course the make-up ... all work together to create an excellent dr seuss feel ..</td>', 'another awesome photograph ... you were up against some amazing images in this challenge .. i love the expression, the eyes, the hands, the hair, the scarf, and of course the make-up ... all work together to create an excellent dr seuss feel ..', '2007-05-21 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3680044, 506222, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fascinating.  You often come up with interesting takes on the challenge.  Thanks for teaching me something about Geisel!  I went home and told my wife, who also didn''t know that about him.  Between this and JuliBoc''s entry, I''ve learned a lot.</td>', 'Fascinating.  You often come up with interesting takes on the challenge.  Thanks for teaching me something about Geisel!  I went home and told my wife, who also didn''t know that about him.  Between this and JuliBoc''s entry, I''ve learned a lot.', '2007-05-22 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
